- look_at_images: View MULTIPLE images from one message at once. Use when a message has 2+ image attachments. For a single image use look_at_image.
- save_attachments: Download ALL attachments from a message into the workspace in ONE call (images binary-safe, code/text byte-exact). ALWAYS use this when someone shares files to build from (sprite sheets, .js/.html code, assets) — never download them one by one.
- get_weather: Get current weather + 3-day forecast for any city. Use when someone asks about the weather.
- create_poll: Create a Discord poll (2-5 options) for users to vote on.
- summarize_thread: Summarize the last N messages in the current channel. Use when someone asks "what did I miss" or wants to catch up.
